 33.109375 \nQ 10.359375 33.890625 10.359375 34.28125 \nQ 10.640625 35.9375 13.953125 39.203125 \nQ 17.28125 42.484375 20.3125 42.484375 \nz\n\" id=\"CrimsonText-Italic-120\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g transform=\"translate(339.295416 323.998038)scale(0.2 -0.2)\">\n<use xlink:href=\"#CrimsonText-Italic-120\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g id=\"line2d_1\">\n<defs>\n<path d=\"M 0 3 \nC 0.795609 3 1.55874 2.683901 2.12132 2.12132 \nC 2.683901 1.55874 3 0.795609 3 0 \nC 3 -0.795609 2.683901 -1.55874 2.12132 -2.12132 \nC 1.55874 -2.683901 0.795609 -3 0 -3 \nC -0.795609 -3 -1.55874 -2.683901 -2.12132 -2.12132 \nC -2.683901 -1.55874 -3 -0.795609 -3 0 \nC -3 0.795609 -2.683901 1.55874 -2.12132 2.12132 \nC -1.55874 2.683901 -0.795609 3 0 3 \nz\n\" id=\"m5ec15a0b19\" style=\"stroke:#000000;\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g clip-path=\"url(#pc4db36c1a7)\">\n<use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"72.673142\" xlink:href=\"#m5ec15a0b19\" y=\"283.653134\"></use>\n<use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"115.044144\" xlink:href=\"#m5ec15a0b19\" y=\"229.726404\"></use>\n<use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"149.711328\" xlink:href=\"#m5ec15a0b19\" y=\"193.775251\"></use>\n<use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"192.08233\" xlink:href=\"#m5ec15a0b19\" y=\"157.824098\"></use>\n<use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"149.711328\" xlink:href=\"#m5ec15a0b19\" y=\"229.726404\"></use>\n<use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"192.08233\" xlink:href=\"#m5ec15a0b19\" y=\"211.750828\"></use>\n<use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"222.897604\" xlink:href=\"#m5ec15a0b19\" y=\"157.824098\"></use>\n<use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"222.897604\" xlink:href=\"#m5ec15a0b19\" y=\"121.872944\"></use>\n<use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"265.268606\" xlink:href=\"#m5ec15a0b19\" y=\"85.921791\"></use>\n<use style=\"stroke:#000000;\" x=\"311.491518\" xlink:href=\"#m5ec15a0b19\" y=\"85.921791\"></use>\n</g>\n</g>\n<g id=\"line2d_2\">\n<path clip-path=\"url(#pc4db36c1a7)\" d=\"M 53.413596 294.875707 \nL 323.047246 58.747597 \nL 323.047246 58.747597 \n\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:#000000;stroke-linecap:square;stroke-width:2.3;\"></path>\n</g>\n</g>\n</g>\n<defs>\n<clipPath id=\"pc4db36c1a7\">\n<rect height=\"347.76\" width=\"349.984478\" x=\"9.867761\" y=\"7.2\"></rect>\n</clipPath>\n</defs>\n</svg>\n<div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Long description for scatterplot\" class=\"sr-only\"><ul><li>The scatterplot has 10 data points.</li><li>The data points are in a linear pattern trending up from left to right.</li><li>A line of best fit is shown:<br><ul><li>The line of best fit slants up from left to right.</li><li>The line of best fit passes through the following approximate coordinates:<br><ul><li>(1 comma 3.3)</li><li>(3 comma 7.0)</li><li>(5 comma 10.8)</li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></div></figure></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Which of the following is closest to the slope of the line of best fit shown?</p>","answerOptions":[{"id":"7e41a0ce-e619-4ba8-a8cc-6fe60961875e","content":"<p><math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"5013d79e-8bbc-4490-8171-ff40e47109b7","content":"<p><math alttext=\"one half\"><mfrac>\n\t<mn>1</mn>\n\t<mn>2</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"b56ea4f0-be59-43cc-a821-b69e0fc1bd28","content":"<p><math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math></p>"},{"id":"035e9c26-e0a8-43a7-b3a3-7a6cfab55557","content":"<p><math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math></p>"}],"keys":["035e9c26-e0a8-43a7-b3a3-7a6cfab55557"],"correct_answer":["D"],"rationale":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is correct. A line in the <em>xy</em>-plane that passes through the points <math alttext=\"left parenthesis x 1 comma y 1 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> and&nbsp;<math alttext=\"left parenthesis x 2 comma y 2 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> has a slope of <math alttext=\"StartFraction y 2 minus y 1 Over x 2 minus x 1 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>. The line of best fit shown passes approximately through the points <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 1 comma 3.3 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3.3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math alttext=\"left parenthesis 7 comma 14.5 right parenthesis\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>14.5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>. It follows that the slope of this best fit line is approximately <math alttext=\"StartFraction 14.5 minus 3.3 Over 7 minus 1 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>14.5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3.3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, which is equivalent to <math alttext=\"StartFraction 11.2 Over 6 EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>11.2</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>, or approximately <math alttext=\"1.87\"><mn>1.87</mn>\n</math>. Therefore, of the given choices, <math alttext=\"2\"><mn>2</mn>\n</math> is closest to the slope of the line of best fit shown.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>","parenttemplatename":null,"parenttemplateid":null,"templateclusterid":null,"templateclustername":null,"origin":null,"position":null,"image_count":0,"raw_list":{"updateDate":1743430554984,"pPcc":"SAT#Q","questionId":"90ba8f98","skill_cd":"Q.D.","score_band_range_cd":4,"skill_desc":"Two-variable data: Models and scatterplots","createDate":1743430554984,"program":"SAT","primary_class_cd_desc":"Problem-Solving and Data Analysis","ibn":"","external_id":"a3419986-a630-4b5b-9c48-62a85f09b32e","primary_class_cd":