nt sign\"><mn>21</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of <math alttext=\"100\"><mn>100</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect.&nbsp;<math alttext=\"21 percent sign\"><mn>21</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"21\"><mn>21</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect.&nbsp;<math alttext=\"21 percent sign\"><mn>21</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of <math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"0.21\"><mn>0.21</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"21\"><mn>21</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect.&nbsp;<math alttext=\"21 percent sign\"><mn>21</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of <math alttext=\"42\"><mn>42</mn>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"8.82\"><mn>8.82</mn>\n</math>, not <math alttext=\"21\"><mn>21</mn>\n</math>.</p>","stem":"<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"21\"><mn>21</mn>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"21 percent sign\"><mrow><mn>21</mn></mrow><mo>%</mo></math> of what number?</p>","type":"mcq","correct_answer":["D"]},"createDate":1730147357402,"updateDate":1730147357402}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1730147357402, 1730147357402),
